# [Goal Description]
**Target**: Build the **GSD AI Training Academy**—where we train humans to be **Orchestrators** of AI.
**Core Concept**: The "Symphony" of Operations. SOPs are the "Musical Score." The Agents are the "Musicians." The GSD Staff Member is the "Conductor."

## User Review Required
